<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Hi, I'm Gail! </strong>I make unecessary but wonderful desserts, baked goods, and drinks inspired by my favourite sweets, twists on classics, and flavours from my Asian-Canadian background. I hope you find your next favourite recipe here!</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><a href="/about">Learn more about me →</a></p>
